    "solution": "平方差公式：\\((a+2)(a-2)=a^2-4\\)；单项式乘多项式：\\(a(3-a)=3a-a^2\\)。相加：\\(a^2-4+3a-a^2=3a-4\\)。",
    "secs": [
      "j16-3"
    ],
    "prereq_secs": [
      "j16-2"
